# Agentic SDLC - 1.04 (2026-07-05)

- Artifact-based SDLC — every stage is a JSON artifact written incrementally via MCP tools
- Four structured phases: 1-foundation, 2-business-spec, 3-tech-spec, 4-implement
- MCP server with a strict return contract (read-only, write, reconciliation tools)
- Dep-graph with automatic staleness propagation across artifacts
- 14 specialized agents (content / infrastructure / orchestration)
- Orchestrator loop: code-writer -> test-writer -> test-runner
- Per-artifact commands plus acceleration commands (fast-bootstrap, fast-screen)
- Maintenance commands: revise, commit, check-stale, whats-next
- HITL gate (GO / REVISE / STOP) before every artifact write
- Templates & schemas per artifact for structure validation
- Screen-driven implementation with bounded auto-fix (max_retries)
- Full test generation: unit (BE/FE), integration, component, browser
- Visual preview & per-screen HTML mocks for UIUX validation
- Web dashboard for artifact and dep-graph status
- MCP tool testing discipline (fs fixture + monkeypatching)
